<title>FRANCE: EU raises daily wheat export refund to Switzerland.</title>
<headline>EU raises daily wheat export refund to Switzerland.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union raised the daily refund applying to soft wheat exports to Switzerland, Liechtenstein and the Spanish territories of Ceuta and Melilla to four Ecus per tonne from a previous level of two Ecus per tonne, grain industry sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>The EU cut the refund on rye exports to the same destinations to 21.50 Ecus per tonne from a previous level of 22.00 Ecus per tonne, they said.</p>
<p>The EU took the decision at a weekly meeting of its grain panel on Thursday.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
